# Topic rules for the broker (step 8). Anything not allowed here is refused:
# a client may only read or write the topics listed for it.
# (%u means "this client's own user name". A node's user name is its node id.)

# The server reads everything the nodes send and writes resend requests.
user server
topic read monitor/#
topic write control/#

# Tools on your PC (listener.py) may only read.
user tools
topic read monitor/#

# The broker's health check only needs to log in; it may read and write nothing.
user healthcheck

# Every node may only write its own topics and read its own resend requests,
# so one node can't pretend to be another or read another's control messages.
pattern write monitor/%u/#
pattern read control/%u/#
